  "description": "Same soul, new frame. The Raleigh ONE Step Through takes everything that makes the ONE good and pours it into a low step frame, so getting on is never a chore again. The clean aluminium frame, the flush handlebar and the hidden cables stay. The Mivice rear hub motor adds a quiet push up to 25 km/h, and the 360 Wh battery slips out to charge. The Gates Carbon belt wants no oil and no rust. Wide tyres and Tektro hydraulic discs keep you calm, and tracking, alarm and auto-lock through the Raleigh app make your phone the cockpit. The same bike, accessible to more riders than ever. Important Please be aware that this bike is regulated in line with existing Electric Power Assisted Cycles regulations. Any modification to the bike will invalidate the guarantee and in particular any modification which increases the power of the motor and/or the top assisted speed of the bike may make the rider liable to prosecution. Excluding statutory obligations Raleigh will not be held responsible for any injuries incurred following any modification to this product.",
